BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Question) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691.8 Tm (In what order does SQL logically execute the clauses of a query? Why can you not use a column) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 678.3 Tm (alias defined in SELECT inside the WHERE clause?) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 648.8 Tm (Answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 623.6 Tm (SQL is declarative, so written order is not execution order. The logical processing order) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 610.1 Tm (is:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 586.6 Tm (1. FROM        pick the source tables) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 576.6 Tm (2. ON / JOIN   match rows between them) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 566.6 Tm (3. WHERE       filter individual rows      <-- aliases from SELECT not visible yet) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 556.6 Tm (4. GROUP BY    collapse rows into groups) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 546.6 Tm (5. HAVING      filter groups               <-- aggregates allowed here) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 536.6 Tm (6. SELECT      compute output expressions  <-- aliases are CREATED here) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 526.6 Tm (7. DISTINCT    remove duplicate output rows) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 516.6 Tm (8. ORDER BY    sort the result             <-- aliases ARE visible) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 506.6 Tm (9. LIMIT/OFFSET  slice the sorted result) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 485.6 Tm (A SELECT alias is created at step 6. WHERE runs at step 3, three steps earlier, so the name) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 472.1 Tm (does not exist yet - hence column "x" does not exist. ORDER BY runs at step 8, after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 458.6 Tm (SELECT, which is why sorting by an alias works. \(PostgreSQL and MySQL allow alias in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 445.1 Tm (ORDER BY; the standard also permits it there and nowhere earlier.\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 426.6 Tm (The physical plan may differ wildly from this order - the optimiser reorders freely - but only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 413.1 Tm (in ways that cannot change the result.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 383.6 Tm (Example) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 358.4 Tm (Computing a discounted order total once and filtering on it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 328.9 Tm (Code Example) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 298.7 Tm (-- FAILS: alias not yet defined when WHERE runs) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 288.7 Tm (-- SELECT order_id, quantity * unit_price AS line_total) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 278.7 Tm (-- FROM   order_items) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 268.7 Tm (-- WHERE  line_total > 50000;) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 258.6 Tm (-- ERROR:  column "line_total" does not exist) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 241.3 Tm (-- Fix 1: repeat the expression) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 231.3 Tm (SELECT order_id,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 221.3 Tm (       quantity * unit_price AS line_total) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 211.3 Tm (FROM   order_items) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 201.2 Tm (WHERE  quantity * unit_price > 50000) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 191.2 Tm (ORDER  BY line_total DESC;          -- alias legal here) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 173.9 Tm (-- Fix 2 \(cleaner, no repetition\): compute in a subquery / CTE, filter outside) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 163.9 Tm (SELECT order_id, line_total) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 153.9 Tm (FROM  \(SELECT order_id, quantity * unit_price AS line_total) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 143.8 Tm (       FROM   order_items\) t) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 133.8 Tm (WHERE line_total > 50000) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 123.8 Tm (ORDER BY line_total DESC;) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 281.0 32 Tm 0.45 g (Page 8 of 56) Tj ET 0 g
endstream
