BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 628.2 Tm (FALSE    UNKNOWN  FALSE    UNKNOWN) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 618.0 Tm (UNKNOWN  UNKNOWN  UNKNOWN  UNKNOWN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 595.8 Tm (Consequences that show up in real bugs:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.7 Tf 1 0 0 1 66 577.2 Tm (- NULL = NULL is UNKNOWN, but NULL IS NOT DISTINCT FROM NULL is TRUE.) Tj ET
