BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 326.1 Tm (Compute the effective total per order \(discount is often NULL\), and a stock turnover ratio) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 312.6 Tm (where stock_qty can legitimately be 0 \(ProBook 15\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 283.1 Tm (Code Example) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 252.9 Tm (-- 1. COALESCE supplies a default for a NULL discount) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 242.9 Tm (SELECT o.order_id,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 232.9 Tm (       o.discount_pct                              AS raw_discount,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 222.9 Tm (       COALESCE\(o.discount_pct, 0\)                 AS effective_discount,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 212.9 Tm (       SUM\(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price\)            AS gross,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 202.9 Tm (       ROUND\(SUM\(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price\)) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 192.9 Tm (             * \(1 - COALESCE\(o.discount_pct, 0\) / 100\), 2\) AS net_payable) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 182.9 Tm (FROM   orders o) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 172.9 Tm (JOIN   order_items oi ON oi.order_id = o.order_id) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 162.9 Tm (GROUP  BY o.order_id, o.discount_pct) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 152.9 Tm (ORDER  BY o.order_id;) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 135.5 Tm (-- 2. NULLIF prevents division by zero for the zero-stock product) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 125.5 Tm (SELECT p.name,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 115.5 Tm (       p.stock_qty,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 105.5 Tm (       SUM\(oi.quantity\)                                        AS units_sold,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 95.5 Tm (       ROUND\(SUM\(oi.quantity\)::numeric / NULLIF\(p.stock_qty, 0\), 2\) AS turnover,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 85.5 Tm (       COALESCE\(ROUND\(SUM\(oi.quantity\)::numeric) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 75.5 Tm (                      / NULLIF\(p.stock_qty, 0\), 2\), 0\)         AS turnover_safe) Tj ET
