BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 381.9 Tm (CASE is SQL's conditional expression - it returns a value, so it can appear anywhere a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 368.4 Tm (value can: SELECT, WHERE, ORDER BY, GROUP BY, even inside an aggregate. It is not a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 354.9 Tm (statement and has no side effects.) Tj ET
