BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 559.5 Tm (Show each employee's salary next to their department average and their share of the department) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 546.0 Tm (payroll - impossible with GROUP BY alone without a self join.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 516.5 Tm (Code Example) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 486.3 Tm (SELECT full_name,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 476.3 Tm (       department,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 466.3 Tm (       salary,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 456.3 Tm (       -- department aggregate, but every row is preserved) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 446.3 Tm (       ROUND\(AVG\(salary\) OVER \(PARTITION BY department\), 2\)  AS dept_avg,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 436.3 Tm (       salary - ROUND\(AVG\(salary\) OVER \(PARTITION BY department\), 2\) AS diff_from_avg,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 426.3 Tm (       SUM\(salary\)  OVER \(PARTITION BY department\)           AS dept_payroll,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 416.3 Tm (       ROUND\(100.0 * salary) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 406.3 Tm (             / SUM\(salary\) OVER \(PARTITION BY department\), 1\) AS pct_of_dept,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 396.3 Tm (       COUNT\(*\)     OVER \(PARTITION BY department\)           AS dept_headcount,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 386.3 Tm (       -- running total across the whole company, ordered by hire date) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 376.3 Tm (       SUM\(salary\)  OVER \(ORDER BY hire_date) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 366.3 Tm (                          ROWS BETWEEN UNBOUNDED PRECEDING) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 356.3 Tm (                                   AND CURRENT ROW\)          AS cumulative_payroll) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 346.3 Tm (FROM   employees) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 336.3 Tm (ORDER  BY department, salary DESC;) Tj ET
