BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 717.0 Tm (Why Interviewers Ask This) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691.8 Tm (Window functions are the dividing line between basic and professional SQL. Interviewers use) Tj ET
