BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 322.5 Tm (           SUM\(oi.quantity * oi.unit_price\)               AS revenue) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 312.5 Tm (    FROM   orders o) Tj ET
