BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 232.5 Tm (       LEAD\(revenue\) OVER \(ORDER BY month\)               AS next_month,) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 222.5 Tm (       revenue - LAG\(revenue\) OVER \(ORDER BY month\)      AS delta,) Tj ET
